      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Edgerton%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Edgerton’s 1905‑07 train depot, once a hub between Chicago and Milwaukee, now serves coffee at The Coffee Depot.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
